018","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"如果您面临山体滑坡的风险，请咨询您的保险代理人。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/landslides-debris-flow","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"随着山体滑坡的临近，可以注意到音量逐渐增大的微弱隆隆声。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/landslides-debris-flow","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"他们根据您社区中的威胁提供最新建议。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/landslides-debris-flow","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"许多人死于山体滑坡是在人们睡觉时发生的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/landslides-debris-flow","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-landslides-debris-flow-zh-hans-v1/sentence-059","input":"尽快重新种植受损的土地，因为地面覆盖物丧失造成的侵蚀会在不久的将来导致山洪暴发和更多的山体滑坡。","provenance":{"raw_url":"htt